Place database-native exports here before running 08_r_scripts/AI_PCF_bibliometrix_SWIM_pipeline.R.
Recommended files:
- scopus_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.csv and/or .bib
- wos_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.txt with cited references
- ieee_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.ris/.bib
- optica_spie_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.bib
- sciencedirect_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.ris
- springer_wiley_ai_pcf_YYYYMMDD.ris
Do not manually add unverified citations to the final corpus.
